{
  "description": "Alterations to a detached house: Replacement timber windows throughout, replacement of the existing pitched roof to the entrance lobby with a flat roof and entrance canopy. Conversion of the existing garage into a habitable room, including replacement of the garage door with new windows and a timber screen and new rear doors with steps to the garden. Timber screen to replacement north window. Reconfiguration of the driveway and entrance patio to provide level parking and improved access to the house. Raising of the main garden terrace to align with the internal floor level. New windows to the existing brick sheds below the main terrace\rNew timber pergola to the south terrace. New planted screening along the southern boundary. Replacement of the existing window to the south elevation with a garden door and steps to the lawn",
